Huawei Qingyun L410 (Kirin 990) build inputs, used by l410/build.sh:

  configs/*.config      Kconfig fragments, merged in name order on top of arm64 defconfig
  dt/l410-firmware.dts  device tree the L410 UEFI firmware hands to the vendor 4.19 kernel
                        (decompiled from /sys/firmware/fdt under Kylin)
  dt/fixups.d/*.dtsi    what the 6.18 drivers need changed in it, included in name order
  initramfs/init        busybox init: mounts root= and switches to it (l410.mode=probe only
                        logs diagnostics and reboots)
  firmware/             USB 3.1 combo PHY firmware, built in with CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE
  build.sh              cross-compiles Image, modules, l410.dtb and initrd.img (see --help)

The NN- prefixes only set the order; each file is named after the subsystem it serves.
